<</A 208 0 R/Alt(The bar graph shows TOURIST DEVELOPMENT TAX COLLECTIONS for three fiscal years. The horizontal line has months and the vertical line has numbers in Millions from 0.0 to 35.0 with increments of 5.0. The legends show green bars for the Fiscal Year 2018-19, red bars for the Fiscal Year 2019-20, and blue bars for the Fiscal Year 2020-21. The Month and collection for Fiscal Year 2018-19 are: October 25.0, November, 24.0, December 24.0, January 24.0, February 26.0, March 33.0, April 27.0, May 23.0, June 25.0, July 23.0, August 21.0, September 20.0. The Month and collection for Fiscal Year 2019-20 are: October 25.0, November, 26.0, December 26.0, January 26.0, February 29.0, March 15.0, April 2.0, May 2.5, June 4.0, July 7.0, August 7.5, September 9.0. The Month and collection for the Fiscal Year 2020-21 are October 9.5, November, 10.0, December 12.0, January 8.0, February 10.0, March 12.0.  The numbers are approximate.␀)/ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-        3943)/K 23/P 186 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure>>
